OL,0,         GFORUM64   GSa 21 Nov F17:13:36
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHi Retro-Fellows,                      
OL,5,Gsupported by @znarF and @ILAH several  
OL,6,Gtests have been successful (Option A   
OL,7,Gand B HW) and I was motivated to add   
OL,8,Gsome more features in a brand new V1.10
OL,9,Gof my circle port of Pi1541:           
OL,11,G- D81 Images can be uploaded           
OL,13,G- static network configuration to speed
OL,14,Gup webserver startup (see ReadMe, how  
OL,15,Gto configure in options.txt)           
OL,17,G- healthMonitor on serial console is   
OL,18,Goff by default and can be enabled; when
OL,19,Genabled, temperature is displayed also 
OL,20,Gon the LCD                             
OL,22,G- some more information on webserver,  
OL,23,Gnicer formatting                       
OL,24,D]FForum64.de RSS feed            (2/3) 
